## Gotchas and constraints
_Things future-me (or the agent) should know. Example:_
- GPIO 0 must stay deasserted at boot; don't mux it to anything that could pull it low.
- The charger INT line is active-low and open-drain — don't forget the external pull-up.
- SPI2 runs at 10 MHz; the IMU can't go higher over the flex cable used on rev-A.

