## Schematic conventions
When adding or changing peripherals in the EAGLE schematic, follow the
`BOARD_*` attribute and net-naming conventions documented in
`docs/SCHEMATIC_CONVENTIONS.md`.  After updating the schematic, run
`/board-onboarder` to import the changes into `hardware/board.yaml` and
regenerate `Pins.hpp` with `uv run gen-pins`.
